Covered Material is supplied as available, without promises of accuracy,
fitness, safety, noninfringement, or uninterrupted operation. To the extent
law permits, Licensors disclaim warranties and liability for losses arising
from its use. This does not exclude liability that law prohibits excluding,
or excuse your obligations to people affected by your Deployment.

No endorsement, certification, employment relationship, or partnership is
created by this license. Passing a technical policy check is not proof of
legal compliance. Applicable mandatory law and legally protected rights remain
in force. If a term cannot be enforced, a court may preserve the remaining
terms only to the extent consistent with their purpose and applicable law;
there is no intent to grant unrestricted use if the core conditions in
sections 3 or 4 cannot be enforced. No governing jurisdiction or exclusive
court is selected by this text. A waiver must be express and made by the
Licensor whose rights it concerns. Later license versions do not automatically
replace this version or diminish rights already granted under other licenses.
